    "description": "# RF-14: Primary Referrals Related List\n\n_Related list of Referrals where this Referrer is the Primary Referrer._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Columns: Referral ID, Player, Payout Type, Operator, Logged, Proof, Referral Status, Payment Status\n\n* Referral Status values: Validated, Cross-Book Review, Flagged. Payment Status flow: New → Logged → Paid.\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Replaces the prototype's combined Sign Ups + Referrals lists. Two separate related lists exist: this one for primary referrals, and a second (see BUILD-199) for secondary referrals — each referral links to the Referrer separately.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-14 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n* Depends on the Referral object existing — no Asana ticket for it yet.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-14 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Joyce Kiddell, 1:38:15 (signups → referrals)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5895)\n* [Aug 18 Weekly Sync — Kobi Kunasekaran, 1:38:27 (primary/secondary split)](https://fathom.video/calls/787411922?timestamp=5907)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
